  "description": "Upgrade your 2007-2014 Ford F-150 with this multifunctional driver-side mirror, designed for improved safety and convenience. Measuring 13.7\" in length with a 10.2”×8” mirror size, it features power-adjustable and heated glass for clear visibility in all weather conditions. The integrated LED turn signal adds a modern touch while enhancing safety on the road. The manual folding function provides flexibility in tight spaces.\nFitment\n2007-2014 Ford F-150 series truck\nFits New Body Style F150 models\nDoes not fit Old Body Style Heritage Models\nFeatures\nFitment: compatible with 2007-2014 Ford F-150 series truck\nPackage contents & dimensions: the left driver side mirror, side mirror length is 13.7\"; side mirror size is 10.2”×8”\nFunctions: featuring a power adjustable & power heated plane mirror, LED turn signal, and manual folding, the multifunctional side mirror can strikingly enhance your driving experience\nEasy to install: just simply connect the plugs of the trailer door mirror to the corresponding power cord, no drilling or modifications are required（professional installation would be highly recommended）\nNote: Please check if your vehicle has the same functions as that of the door mirror, such as the turn signal, otherwise some functions of the door mirror will be disabled when the vehicle does not possess the corresponding functions",
